Patch T7 oracles (rung 1b, task T7; gate G5): protect eng-gpu's shader
test, and run it as the `shaders` step.

- crates/eng-gpu/tests/shaders.rs joins protected.toml and
  .github/CODEOWNERS (proposal 8, criterion 10 `shaders`): every WGSL file
  validates at Tier 0 and translates to SPIR-V, MSL and HLSL.
- X7's `shaders` step (proposal 7, amendment 11): `cargo xtask ci --job
  test` runs eng-gpu's `shaders` test as a step of its own, after
  `wire-session`. A row of `HARNESSES`, in the form t6-oracles.patch gives
  it.
- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md names the step.

Base: main at 31c3a8c with t6-oracles.patch applied, which reworks
`HARNESSES`, and with T7 (t7-libm.patch and t7-eng-gpu.patch), which adds
the test file. At the repo root, run `git apply` with this file, then
`cargo xtask quick` and `cargo xtask ci --job test`. Session 17's T7 entry
in PROGRESS.md says how it was tested.
Text before the first `diff --git` line is ignored by `git apply`.

